{
  "_meta": {
    "note": "Curated price overrides. Always wins over LiteLLM. Two reasons to live here: (1) self-defined alias names that LiteLLM will never carry (kiro-*, hy3-*, composer-*, kimi-for-coding, free-tier OpenRouter routes); (2) prices we want to pin even if LiteLLM has the model (e.g. cache_write fields LiteLLM often omits). Units: USD per million tokens. Edit this file to override pricing without redeploying.",
    "units": "usd_per_million_tokens",
    "deepseek_v4_pricing_note": "Official DeepSeek V4 pricing verified on 2026-08-21. Peak hours are 01:00-04:00 and 06:00-10:00 UTC; all other hours are off-peak at half price. Exact entries store peak rates. computeRowCost applies the time-of-use discount from each row's UTC hour_start.",
    "iflytek_maas_pricing_note": "iFlytek MaaS inference prices supplied for AStudio on 2026-08-31. AStudio homepage: https://agent.xfyun.cn/. Official pricing source: https://maas.xfyun.cn/modelSquare. Source values are RMB per million tokens, converted at 7.2 RMB/USD, then rounded to two decimal places for billing. Models without a dedicated cache-hit price use the normal input rate; cache writes also use the normal input rate. iFlytek MaaS prices are source-scoped and do not inherit DeepSeek time-of-use discounts."
  },
